---
source: crates/test-framework/src/snapshot/mod.rs
description: "Query: tpch_q5"
---
+---------------+----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------+
| plan_type     | plan                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                       |
+---------------+----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------+
| logical_plan  | Federated                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                  |
|               |  Sort: revenue DESC NULLS FIRST                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                            |
|               |   Projection: ducklake.main.nation.n_name, sum(ducklake.main.lineitem.l_extendedprice * Int64(1) - ducklake.main.lineitem.l_discount) AS revenue                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                           |
|               |     Aggregate: groupBy=[[ducklake.main.nation.n_name]], aggr=[[sum(ducklake.main.lineitem.l_extendedprice * (Int64(1) - ducklake.main.lineitem.l_discount))]]                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                              |
|               |       Inner Join:  Filter: ducklake.main.nation.n_regionkey = ducklake.main.region.r_regionkey                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                             |
|               |         Inner Join:  Filter: ducklake.main.supplier.s_nationkey = ducklake.main.nation.n_nationkey                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                         |
|               |           Inner Join:  Filter: ducklake.main.lineitem.l_suppkey = ducklake.main.supplier.s_suppkey AND ducklake.main.customer.c_nationkey = ducklake.main.supplier.s_nationkey                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                             |
|               |             Inner Join:  Filter: ducklake.main.lineitem.l_orderkey = ducklake.main.orders.o_orderkey                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                       |
|               |               Inner Join:  Filter: ducklake.main.customer.c_custkey = ducklake.main.orders.o_custkey                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                       |
|               |                 TableScan: ducklake.main.customer projection=[c_custkey, c_nationkey]                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                      |
|               |                 TableScan: ducklake.main.orders projection=[o_orderkey, o_custkey], full_filters=[ducklake.main.orders.o_orderdate >= CAST(Utf8("1994-01-01") AS Date32), ducklake.main.orders.o_orderdate < CAST(Utf8("1995-01-01") AS Date32)]                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                           |
|               |               TableScan: ducklake.main.lineitem projection=[l_orderkey, l_suppkey, l_extendedprice, l_discount]                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                            |
|               |             TableScan: ducklake.main.supplier projection=[s_suppkey, s_nationkey]                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                          |
|               |           TableScan: ducklake.main.nation projection=[n_nationkey, n_name, n_regionkey]                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                    |
|               |         TableScan: ducklake.main.region projection=[r_regionkey], full_filters=[ducklake.main.region.r_name = Utf8("ASIA")]                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                |
| physical_plan | SchemaCastScanExec                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                         |
|               |   CooperativeExec                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                          |
|               |     BytesProcessedExec                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                     |
|               |       VirtualExecutionPlan name=duckdb compute_context=:memory: base_sql=SELECT "n_name", sum(("lineitem"."l_extendedprice" * (1 - "lineitem"."l_discount"))) AS "revenue" FROM "ducklake"."main"."customer" INNER JOIN "ducklake"."main"."orders" ON ("customer"."c_custkey" = "orders"."o_custkey") INNER JOIN "ducklake"."main"."lineitem" ON ("lineitem"."l_orderkey" = "orders"."o_orderkey") INNER JOIN "ducklake"."main"."supplier" ON (("lineitem"."l_suppkey" = "supplier"."s_suppkey") AND ("customer"."c_nationkey" = "supplier"."s_nationkey")) INNER JOIN "ducklake"."main"."nation" ON ("supplier"."s_nationkey" = "nation"."n_nationkey") INNER JOIN "ducklake"."main"."region" ON ("nation"."n_regionkey" = "region"."r_regionkey") WHERE ("orders"."o_orderdate" >= CAST('1994-01-01' AS DATE)) AND ("orders"."o_orderdate" < CAST('1995-01-01' AS DATE)) AND ("region"."r_name" = 'ASIA') GROUP BY "nation"."n_name" ORDER BY "revenue" DESC NULLS FIRST |
|               |                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                            |
+---------------+----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------+
